  "design": "Both runs use the same chat checkpoint, classifier, book and MiniLM reader. The changed policy lets a different cited extract replace a classifier reply when the citation covers at least 75% of the distinct question terms, with at least two terms in the question. Development checks used the existing memory and coverage development sets plus validation. The fresh 12-turn fixture was frozen before evaluation and its annotated source ranges do not overlap those in the prior fixtures.",
